WEBVTT

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:33.220
Wait right there!

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:35.370
So you're Zagart?!

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.610
Let's do it, Cerberus!

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:43.910
Zagart, the man with his eyes set on our four
Sacred Beasts, was Zeo's father all along!

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:49.790
And Zeo will enter the tournament with the intention of stealing the four Sacred Beasts!

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:58.260
Despite our shock, the final rounds of the world championships are about to begin!

00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:59.810
Go, Dragoon!

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:00.980
Driger!

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:02.220
Dranzer!

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:03.640
Draciel!

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:23.650
Ladies and gentlemen! It's time for the final
rounds of the 2002 world championships!

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:31.890
The crowd's got a totally different
feel here in the final rounds...

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.340
Of course!

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:39.520
This tournament will decide who's the best
Blader among all 300 million around the world.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:49.480
Allow me to introduce the tag pairs who
made it past the qualifying rounds!

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:56.110
First, last year's champions, the BBA team!
Who won their way up with their amazing power!

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.820
The Kai Hiwatari/Rei Kon team!

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:02.520
And the Takao Kinomiya/
Max Mizuhara team!

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:05.050
Thank you!

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:07.400
You can do it, guys!

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.260
Thank you, thank you!

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.700
Will the BBA team
win again this year?

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:19.510
The ones who may block their path to
victory include the Ozma/Dunga team!

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.860
And the Mariam/Yusuf team!

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:26.510
The Kane Yamashita/Jim team!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.140
The Sanchez/Marco team!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:33.040
And the King/Queen team!

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.580
They don't have
many fans, do they?

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:45.740
Because they steal parts
from everyone's Beyblades!

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:50.320
You got off easy last
night! But not today!

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:53.530
Smile all you want 'cuz
your days are numbered!

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:55.460
I'm looking forward to it.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.580
Make sure you meet
us in the finals then.

00:03:58.580 --> 00:03:59.660
What?!

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:03.520
And the last pair is
the Zeo/Gordo team!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:12.740
These are the first matchups
for the final rounds!

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:15.860
The team with two wins
goes to the next round!

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:20.160
In the case of a tie, the Bladers who
won their battles will break the tie!

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:23.560
The opening battle
will be in one hour!

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:28.580
The Ozma/Dunga team will
fight the Zeo/Gordo team!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:32.580
Look forward to an
awesome battle!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:36.160
Go, Shoot!

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:45.360
Good work out there.
That was a great opening ceremony.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:49.520
I can't believe it's
finally happening!

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:51.440
Where's Takao?

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.760
He went to go see Zeo.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.000
Oh...

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.200
Is he here?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:58.500
Over there.

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:10.080
Zeo! Zeo!

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:11.680
Zeo!

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:15.120
What is it?

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.540
Where's Zeo?
We need to talk!

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.490
Talk?

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:20.100
He's here, right?

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:23.460
He has nothing
to say to you.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:24.970
What?

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.010
Just move aside!

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:30.980
What the hell, man?

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:33.120
Show some restraint for once.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.810
We're preparing
for our battle.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.330
I'll be right back.

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:42.800
Kinomiya.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:44.020
Yeah?

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.010
The final rounds are
about to begin.

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:54.330
Yeah...

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:59.120
What happened to you, Zeo?
You just have to tell me.

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:01.450
Zeo!

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:03.600
You know about
my dad, don't you?

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:04.700
I do...

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:07.760
Then you should be
able to fill in the blanks.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:10.890
I can't! It doesn't
make any sense!

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:15.200
I know your dad is after
the four Sacred Beasts.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.140
But so what?!

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.480
That has nothing
to do with you!

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:23.240
There must be some
sort of reason, right?

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:26.760
There's no way you'd try
to steal our Sacred Beasts.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:30.060
You have to tell me!
We're friends, aren't we?

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:31.600
Friends?

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.130
Yeah, friends!

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.780
We used to be, didn't we?

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:39.490
But not anymore!
We are enemies!

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:42.690
I will defeat you and obtain
the four Sacred Beasts!

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.460
End of story.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:47.400
But why, Zeo...?

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:50.080
What turned you into this?

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.590
Tell me!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.080
I'll say this.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:58.160
You're in for a rude awakening if you
think I'm the same person I used to be.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:02.080
You won't be able to protect
Seiryu with an attitude like that.

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:03.760
Zeo!

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.990
I heard the whole thing.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:09.850
Ozma!

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:13.820
I never would have thought
he'd be in cahoots with Zagart.

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:18.050
No! Zeo's not working for him!
I don't believe that!

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:20.290
There has to
be a reason!

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.960
So what if there is?

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:25.890
He wants Seiryu.

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:27.930
That's the truth.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:32.820
Maybe it was a mistake
to leave Seiryu in your hands.

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:38.090
He's right.
You can't protect Seiryu!

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:42.210
Pull out your Beyblade!
I'll seal Seiryu right here and now!

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:51.260
Fine.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:54.920
Did you see him?

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:55.940
Yeah...

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:06.370
Thanks for waiting!

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:09.240
Time for the opening match
of the final rounds!

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:12.770
Who's going to
win this match?

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.690
Allow me to
introduce them again!

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:22.170
The final rounds of the
2002 Beyblade world championships!

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:26.780
The Bladers fighting in the opening battle! The Ozma/Dunga team!

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:30.480
And the Zeo/Gordo team!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:53.410
If Rei and Kai win their match,
they'll fight whoever wins this one.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:57.450
Let's see what kind of
battle this turns out to be.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.360
Oops! I need to record!

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:04.540
The first battle will
be Dunga VS Gordo!

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:08.960
I'm gonna beat you with style!
A perfect fit for an opening battle!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.650
Are you ready?

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.070
Three! Two! One!

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:18.220
--Go, Shoot!

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:23.650
--Go, Dunga! You got this!
--He's got power, if nothing else.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:28.010
Let's finish this
quick, Voltic Ape!

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:30.250
Orthros!

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:32.610
What?!

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:34.320
Gordo dodged it!

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:37.260
This time for sure! Go!

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:45.660
Dodged again! Gordo's totally
seeing through Dunga's moves!

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:51.200
This Gordo person
is pretty good.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:55.700
Dunga! Your moves
are too wide!

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:58.250
I know! Go!

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:03.540
That idiot's letting
his blood boil.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.650
He's gonna lose if
he doesn't wise up!

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:12.340
What's wrong? I thought you were
going to beat me with style.

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:14.920
That tears it!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.980
Calm down, Dunga!

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.490
Time for me
to get serious!

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:22.120
Voltic Ape!

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:34.960
Orthros!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.960
It's from the tablet!

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:51.520
What amazing spin speed!

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:54.020
Nothing less from
the final rounds!

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:56.220
This battle will be amazing!

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:58.880
Voltic Ape!

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:04.010
Orthros!

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:10.800
Go!!

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:12.600
I won't lose!

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:23.760
Wow! Dunga's Sacred Beast
is getting pushed back!

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:26.980
I didn't think a Sacred Beast from
the tablet could be so powerful...

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:29.140
Don't falter! Don't!

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:30.720
I won't lose!

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:33.280
Go!

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:34.890
Orthros!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.850
It's over! What power!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.010
Gordo is incredible!

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:59.920
I lost... But how?!

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:05.330
Will the Zeo/Gordo team win
again and make it to round two?

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:11.650
Or can the Ozma/Dunga team turn
it around and even the score?

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:16.200
It's finally Zeo's turn.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:29.430
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:39.740
What's that
look in his eyes?

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:44.760
Is this the same fledgling
Blader from before?!

00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:01.210
Show them all the
power of Cerberus, Zeo.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:04.210
Time for me to see
the power of Cerberus.

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:06.410
Three! Two! One!

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.900
--Go, Shoot!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:14.570
Look at that! 60,000 RPM!
They're almost even!

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:17.940
You cannot have
the four Sacred Beasts!

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:20.680
Flash Leopard!

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:24.370
Burning Cerberus!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.740
What an intense clash!

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.450
Go!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.600
I will not lose!

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:40.920
Kyoujyu!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:44.090
Neither one is giving
an inch. They're even!

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:47.180
When did he
get so strong?

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:50.860
Ozma! Pound that
Beyblade into the dirt!

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.240
Flash Leopard!

00:13:57.260 --> 00:14:01.060
Flash Leopard's
charging right in!

00:14:02.140 --> 00:14:03.780
Go!

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:12.280
Nice, Ozma!
Wrap this up quick!

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:15.880
Ozma's one or
two steps ahead.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:20.160
Even if Zeo's stronger now,
it won't be easy to beat him.

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:26.930
What's wrong with you, Zeo?
You should be much stronger than this.

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:31.810
Show me your firm resolve to
steal the four Sacred Beasts.

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:37.770
What?

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:40.370
He's been knocked back!

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:42.690
He blew back Ozma's Bey!

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.440
But how?

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.300
Go!

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.880
Zeo's fighting back!

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:52.980
Drat! He's tough...

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:04.820
This is Zeo's determination to
take the four Sacred Beasts!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.530
We are enemies!

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:12.650
I will defeat you and obtain
the four Sacred Beasts!

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:14.470
End of story.

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:20.130
Go!

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.420
Ozma!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.540
I will not lose
to the likes of you!

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.800
I must protect the
four Sacred Beasts!

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:34.970
Flash Leopard!

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:37.610
Burning Cerberus!

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.120
What an amazing battle!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:50.490
This is a battle fit
for the final rounds!

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:53.490
There's no telling
who's going to win!

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:56.010
You stubborn brat!

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:58.280
Flash Leopard!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:02.380
Flash Leopard is
pushing Cerberus!

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:04.360
Will Ozma
finish the battle?

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:06.600
Go!

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:12.170
Cerberus is losing power!

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:14.950
Go for it, Ozma!
Push him out!

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:22.690
Zeo...

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:32.720
You're lying!

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:37.250
I won't lose!

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:46.420
What?!

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:48.400
What is this power?!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:51.730
Cerberus is gaining power!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:08.900
W-Wow!

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:10.680
Here it comes.

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:18.040
Burning Cerberus!!

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:45.540
Is that Zeo's
Sacred Beast?

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:53.440
It's emitting incredible power! It's on another level from the other Sacred Beasts from the tablet!

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:56.960
Ozma!
Don't hold back!

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:59.520
Show him our power!

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.240
Flash Leopard!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.860
I'm just
getting started!

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:20.290
Go!

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:24.500
Cerberus!

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:29.210
Flash Leopard!

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:38.050
Flash Leopard
got blown back!

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.840
It's so powerful!

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.540
Cerberus!

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:47.040
I would never lose to
a tablet Sacred Beast!

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.500
Flash Leopard!

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.800
Go!!

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:13.450
Ozma!!

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:17.460
Go, Cerberus!
Defeat Flash Leopard!

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:22.330
--That's it. Keep attacking,
and don't let up.

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:23.940
--Go!!
--That's it. Keep attacking,
and don't let up.

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:25.180
--That's it. Keep attacking,
and don't let up.

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:28.010
You little...

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.460
Flash Leopard is
losing power!

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:35.520
Where is all that
power coming from?

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:36.820
Zeo...

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:42.860
--Ozma!!

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:48.490
I will not
lose to you...

00:19:53.180 --> 00:19:55.740
Cross Fire!

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:03.860
Cerberus!

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:12.770
Chain Storm!!

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:57.530
It's over! The Zeo/Gordo team make it
to round two with two straight wins!

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:01.620
Ozma lost...

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:08.770
Now I see what
Cerberus is capable of.

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:17.160
Cerberus!

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:24.920
What happened there?
What was that noise?

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:32.810
Zeo...

00:22:59.700 --> 00:23:02.560
The intense battles continue in the world championships!

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:06.730
The next battle will be between the
King/Queen pair and the Kane/Jim duo!

00:23:06.730 --> 00:23:10.910
Kane and Jim are
attacked before the match!

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:13.200
Is this a meeting of destiny?!

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:16.620
Chairman, when I think of destiny, Beethoven comes to mind!

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:19.010
You said you
like Beythoven?!

00:23:19.010 --> 00:23:21.050
Give me a break!
